1
00:00:04,950 --> 00:00:08,566
警告！查尔斯顿舞会把我们跳成 X 型腿、内八字！
Warning! The Charleston will make us knock-kneed and pigeon-toed!

2
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:13,412
1923 年从百老汇起步，三年后风靡全国！
It kicked off on Broadway in 1923. Three years on, it's the rage!

3
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:17,472
好莱坞明星贝西·洛夫来教你：九步就会！
Hollywood star Bessie Love will teach you, in nine easy steps!

4
00:00:18,050 --> 00:00:21,247
可在迪尔伯恩，亨利·福特另有主意！
But in Dearborn, Henry Ford has other ideas!

5
00:00:21,450 --> 00:00:24,916
福特开的药方？他年轻时跳的老式舞！
Mister Ford's cure? The old-time dances of his youth!

6
00:00:25,030 --> 00:00:28,812
他的书上说：带爵士味的新舞到处失宠！
His book says the jazzy new dances are losing vogue everywhere!

7
00:00:28,870 --> 00:00:32,911
老式舞还是查尔斯顿？去福特工人的野餐会问问！
Old-time or Charleston? Let's ask the Ford workers' picnic!

8
00:00:42,150 --> 00:00:44,867
连小孩都在跳查尔斯顿！
Even the youngsters are doing the Charleston!

9
00:00:44,950 --> 00:00:46,927
X 型腿？谁在乎！
Knock-kneed? Who cares!

10
00:00:47,350 --> 00:00:49,150
本期新闻到此结束！
That's the news!
